cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use viparse in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: viparse
abstract: >-
  A Vietnamese-first document loader for RAG. Converts legacy Vietnamese
  encodings (TCVN3, VNI, VISCII, VPS) to Unicode NFC and extracts text from
  DOCX, XLSX, PDF, scanned PDF, RTF and legacy .doc/.xls into Markdown, text
  or JSON.
authors:
